, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "41603886", "author": {"steamid": "76561198040061777", "personaname": "jkeiding", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198040061777/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 2491, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1381, "last_played": 1716108699, "avatar": "07c7330c61be2f06a77d4495fbba4840f98a4e03"}, "language": "english", "review": "In the name of the divine emperor I order you to paly this game! Anything else would be herresy. This is the most wonderfully gory rendition of space marines in a game, ever! I only have three issues with this game, and giving air to them might land me in the city incinerator to burn as a heretic. Well, here goes:\n 1: I think It would have been way cooler to play it as an ordinary space marine battle brother, and not a chapter captain.\n 2: In chapter 3 \"in the belly of the beast\", the mision description says to destry or retake the orbital deffence gun, but it seems that it is only possible to blow the thing up, and in no way retake it.\n 3: SEQUEL SEQUEL SEQUEL!!! Online fighting is good fun, but I would love to see a sequel (NOT THE CAPTAIN THOUGH) Maybe Leandros rising in the ranks.", "timestamp_created": 1524312598, "timestamp_updated": 1524312598, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "41585160", "author": {"steamid": "76561198043958727", "personaname": "Tankman